                        ],
                        "form": "компромета́циями"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e240a513-01a9-43d6-b8e4-fe344c4194cb",
                        "entry_id": "972bd79b-f069-3025-b782-953f821d96bd",
                        "tags": [
                            "singular",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "компромета́ции"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "1ff8d3ab-1800-407e-b3fc-a4dadc7468be",
                        "entry_id": "972bd79b-f069-3025-b782-953f821d96bd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "компромета́циях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e98381e4-0425-312c-9c64-59340e4437ea",
                        "entry_id": "972bd79b-f069-3025-b782-953f821d96bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. действие по значению гл. компрометировать; нанесение вреда репутации, доброму имени кого-либо, выставление в неблаговидном свете"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a52dae88-7a19-4a38-a7bd-e784ed9d09f4",
                                "sense_id": "e98381e4-0425-312c-9c64-59340e4437ea",
                                "text": "— Гравелот ударил Ван-Конета за оскорбление женщины, — продолжал Галеран, — и если я допускаю, что сигары были подброшены с намерением избегнуть компрометации, возможной после того, как побитый уклонился от дуэли, то любой юрист вправе толковать это как совпадение."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "796f8bcb-98de-4c6e-bdbb-9513aa8d0724",
                                "sense_id": "e98381e4-0425-312c-9c64-59340e4437ea",
                                "text": "Вы знаете, что немецкая социал-демократия своим вотумом о кредитах на войну скомпрометировала интернациональный социализм, что Вандервельде усилил эту компрометацию и что еще раньше поведение таких социалистов, как Вивиани, Мильеран, Бриан э цетера, тоже обнаружили, как бессильна и как, в то же время, печально гибка этика социалистов."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "12ab6e2b-e843-3249-8288-5a66e69ee7d1",
                        "entry_id": "972bd79b-f069-3025-b782-953f821d96bd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. в системах информационной защиты — событие, связанное с получением кем-либо несанкционированного доступа к защищённым данным, утерей носителя закрытого ключа шифрования, несанкционированным копированием и т. п."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f70fb7d4-4dac-477c-9491-427f3fbd4870",
                                "sense_id": "12ab6e2b-e843-3249-8288-5a66e69ee7d1",
                                "text": "Компрометация секретного ключа участника системы ДБО — событие, определенное владельцем секретного ключа как ознакомление неуполномоченным лицом (лицами) с его секретным ключом."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e5d51a9-8546-414b-b415-5bbe1f69581d",
                        "source_entry_id": "972bd79b-f069-3025-b782-953f821d96bd",
                        "source_sense_description": "нанесение вреда репутации, доброму имени кого-либо, выставление в неблаговидном свете",
                        "target_lang_word": "compromise",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "compromise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02b9e308-e352-3365-a5ba-f59ee5115535",
                                        "entry_id": "07635a09-8426-3bb2-a9de-dab41b0a4cef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The settlement of differences by arbitration or by consent reached by mutual concessions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bba109b0-be82-4f30-a350-620a5c849640",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9e308-e352-3365-a5ba-f59ee5115535",
                                                "text": "But basely yielded upon compromise / That which his noble ancestors achieved with blows."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b4627e2c-61f8-4c93-86e7-f86ce2f6d810",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9e308-e352-3365-a5ba-f59ee5115535",
                                                "text": "All government, indeed every human benefit and enjoyment, every virtue and every prudent act, is founded on compromise and barter."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8af9498-bf20-4ea7-b23d-48f6580b3946",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9e308-e352-3365-a5ba-f59ee5115535",
                                                "text": "An abhorrence of concession and compromise is a never failing characteristic of religious factions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6484603a-babe-4ddf-9d61-86163631d999",
                                                "sense_id": "02b9e308-e352-3365-a5ba-f59ee5115535",
                                                "text": "That's the nature of compromises. They truly satisfy no one."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ad72122-400b-3142-857c-de322f5fb84b",
                                        "entry_id": "07635a09-8426-3bb2-a9de-dab41b0a4cef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A committal to something derogatory or objectionable; a prejudicial concession; a surrender."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d54d045-8d1b-4d0b-9d35-4c27998ce88f",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad72122-400b-3142-857c-de322f5fb84b",
                                                "text": "a compromise of character or right"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56e9284f-5e3d-4880-84a9-7445de7e2e3b",
                                                "sense_id": "4ad72122-400b-3142-857c-de322f5fb84b",
                                                "text": "I was determined not to accept any fine speeches, to the compromise of that sex the belonging to which was, after all, my strongest claim and title to them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "13fef350-857d-31d6-a7c0-cc1ec9e84473",
                                        "entry_id": "07635a09-8426-3bb2-a9de-dab41b0a4cef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A breach of a computer or network's rules such that an unauthorized disclosure or loss of sensitive information may have occurred, or the unauthorized disclosure or loss itself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "compromise",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0ab5b293-546b-3c1a-9b20-fc2cddf67d24",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bind by mutual agreement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "ambitransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c585e06-dd80-4f35-b671-c11e91aa5dfe",
                                                "sense_id": "0ab5b293-546b-3c1a-9b20-fc2cddf67d24",
                                                "text": "Laban and himself were compromised / That all the eanlings which were streaked and pied / Should fall as Jacob's hire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f64ac2f-d0cc-3fc2-8deb-dbdb1df07df3",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To adjust and settle by mutual concessions; to compound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a45a5ff0-785b-4497-8034-419081eecf5e",
                                                "sense_id": "0f64ac2f-d0cc-3fc2-8deb-dbdb1df07df3",
                                                "text": "The controversy may easily be compromised."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6818d33-dd99-34a4-8036-9b1a044714f3",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To find a way between extremes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecba59a3-3423-3954-89de-435c4d303a33",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To pledge by some act or declaration; to endanger the life, reputation, etc., of, by some act which can not be recalled; to expose to suspicion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "08fa917d-9633-428d-832d-2a878c1f7a02",
                                                "sense_id": "ecba59a3-3423-3954-89de-435c4d303a33",
                                                "text": "to pardon all who had been compromised in the late disturbances"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "746aefc9-92c7-3910-8328-3032b2ddc1b8",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause impairment of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7982bc44-4c8b-39a7-bbc7-49eb23c3f581",
                                        "entry_id": "5f095869-de53-31cf-ba34-2bf0230d16e3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To breach (a security system)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e276be8a-80cc-483c-b285-03c994e84e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "7982bc44-4c8b-39a7-bbc7-49eb23c3f581",
                                                "text": "They tried to compromise the security in the computer by guessing the password."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
